{title: Kaisi Ye Judai Hai}
{artist: Falak Jannat}
{key: C#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#m] Kaisi Ye Judai Hai,        [A] Aankh Bhar Meri Aayi Hai
[C#m] Mera Dil Doob Raha,        [A] Ise Bas Ab Doobne [B] Do
[C#m] Ye Pehli Bar Hua,        [A] Ye Kyu Ehsaas Hua
[C#m] Mera Dil Ab Toot Raha,        [A] Ise Bas Ab Tootne [B] Do
[C#m] Mujhe Bas Ab Rone Do,        [A] Is Gam Ko Behne Do
[C#m] Ye Sath Jo Toot Raha,        [A] Ise Aaj Bas [B] Chhootne Do
[C#m] Kaisi Ye Judai Hai,        [A] Aankh Bhar Meri Aayi Hai
[C#m] Mera Dil Doob Raha,        [A] Ise Bas Ab Doobne [B] Do
[C#m] [A] [B],        [C#m] Ek Bat Satati Hai,
[A] Jab Teri Yaad Aati Hai,        [C#m] Kyu Mujhse Rooth Gaya,
[A] Jaane Kyu [B] Door Gaya,        [C#m] Ye Pehli Bar Hua,
[A] Ye Kyu Ehsas Hua,        [C#m] Jane Anjane Kyu
[A] Mujhe Tumse [B] Pyar Hua,        [C#m] Hanste Hanste Rota Hu,
[A] Rote Rote Hansta Hun,        [C#m] Phir Khud Se Kehta Hun
[A] Jo Hona [B] Tha.        Hoo Hi Ga [C#m] Ya
